            "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I am afraid, no, not really. There is built-in <a href=\"https://neovim.io/doc/user/diff.html#diff\" rel=\"nofollow\">:h diff</a> that can show the differences. For me an overlay feels more practical.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">ah sad</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I am yet to embark on exploring jj, but there is a feeling that some sort of 'mini.nvim' is possible in the future.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Looking forward to it!, I honestly feel more people will start switching over to jj in the future just because how much it simplifies git</p>",
